window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"tahmkench","b":"locke","win":["Tahm Kench","Tahm Kench","Tahm Kench","Tahm Kench","Skill","Skill","Tahm Kench"],"spikes":[{"when":"Level 1","text":"Tongue Lash reaches 900, Ritual Nails 950 — he pokes first. Step in, step out."},{"when":"Level 3","text":"Abyssal Dive is 21s — spend it only after Ashen Pursuit's flat 10s is gone."},{"when":"Locke level 6","text":"Purgatory is 120s at rank 1 and executes — never end a trade at sliver HP."},{"when":"Two-plus items","text":"Grievous Wounds landed before Soul Ignition expires denies the whole refund."}],"wants":{"you":["Q slows forcing melee trades","Grey health banked before exchanges","Trades ended above his execute line"],"foe":["Nail marks stacked on you before he blinks","A low-HP river of grey health to execute","Your engage baited before he commits"]},"early":"Levels 1 through 5 are a grind he loses, though not for free: Ritual Nails reaches 950 to Tongue Lash's 900, so he pokes first and you answer. What you own is the ten seconds after Ashen Pursuit — flat 10s at every rank, and his only exit. Silver Stake chip becomes grey health you recover; keep leaning on him.","mid":"At 6 and his first item the lane tips to him: Purgatory is 120s and executes, so a fat grey-health bar is a liability rather than a buffer. Soul Ignition is 18s at rank 1 and refunds his HP only when the duration ends — Grievous Wounds applied before it expires cancels the entire refund. End trades above the floor.","late":"With items you scale into exactly what he cannot punish: a peel-tank whose health bar rarely sits below the execute line. Eat Ashen Pursuit with Thick Skin, and hold three An Acquired Taste stacks for Devour rather than the Tongue Lash stun, which consumes the same three — his kit runs out of answers before yours.","whys":["Your level-1 passive stacks and grey health beat his poke outright.","At 2 your Q slow sets up melee trades that he loses.","At level 3, dive only once Ashen Pursuit's flat 10s is spent.","Soul Ignition is 18s and only refunds HP at the end.","At 6 Purgatory's execute on 120s takes the lane off you.","First-item burst arrives and stacked nail marks cash in — grey health is not distance.","With items you scale into a peel-tank his execute cannot punish — the duel is dead for him."]});
