window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"tahmkench","b":"masteryi","win":["Tahm Kench","Tahm Kench","Tahm Kench","Skill","Master Yi","Skill","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Level 1","text":"Tongue Lash's 900 beats Alpha Strike's 600 — bully him off the wave at range."},{"when":"Level 2","text":"Tongue Lash cancels Meditate outright — it is a channel on a flat 10s."},{"when":"Yi level 6","text":"Highlander on 85s makes him immune to every slow — your Tongue Lash slow stops working."},{"when":"Yi two-plus items","text":"Wuju Style is true damage — armour does nothing, so stack HP and peel."}],"wants":{"you":["Early farm denial while he is weak","Stacks banked for Devour, not the stun","Late fights spent peeling, not dueling"],"foe":["Quiet scaling into his 6","Meditate channelled out of Q range","Isolated targets for late reset chains"]},"early":"The first three levels are yours: Tongue Lash reaches 900 to Alpha Strike's 600, so you slow him off the wave for free. The Q only stuns a target already holding three stacks, so build the first two with autos. Meditate is a channel on flat 10s and your Q cancels it — deny that heal.","mid":"Through 4-5 it evens as his DPS ramps and he learns to space your Tongue Lash. At 6 the real change is Highlander, 85s, which makes him immune to every slowing effect — your Q slow stops functioning while it runs. The three-stack stun and Abyssal Dive's knockup still land: slow immunity is not CC immunity.","late":"His first item makes it a race your grey health can contest, but at two-plus items Wuju Style's true damage cuts past armour and he out-duels you solo. So stop soloing: you are the peel — Devour your own carry to shield them, and never spend Devour on Yi as he Alpha Strikes, since he is untargetable for the dash.","whys":["Tongue Lash's 900 beats Alpha Strike's 600 at level 1 — poke freely.","At 2 the Q only stuns if three stacks are already on him.","Level 3: Tongue Lash cancels Meditate, a channel on flat 10s.","Levels 4-5 even out as his DPS ramps and he spaces around your Q.","At 6 Highlander makes him slow-immune, so only your stun still lands.","First item: Meditate on flat 10s means Grievous Wounds decides it.","At 2+ items Wuju Style's true damage ignores your armour — switch fully to peeling."]});
